  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-12-05T07:29:04.289Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "There has been a lot of discussion in the community about the recent removal of colored borders on nametags based on user rank.\nMany players have stated the new tags look bland with no border, and would prefer to have them back, while many others do not like borders based on rank.\nAfter chatting with the community, I've seen several users suggest a customizable color border as a great alternative / compromise. I'd love to see something like this added, that way I can have a pretty nametag once more, and there will be no problems with people bullying users because of their rank.",
